14. **Sequential Processing of Language Information (Sahin et al., 2009)**: Sahin et al. investigate the sequential processing of language information in the brain, revealing how different brain regions work together to comprehend spoken sentences. This work underscores the importance of understanding the temporal dynamics of linguistic processing.

